{"title":"Grave Knight","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 44 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>6</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>10</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>10</td><td>in the wilds around 1798, 1050</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/grave-knight\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>6</td><td>in the wilds around 1799, 1056</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=46\" title=\"Pick level 46\"><td><b>46</b></td><td>254</td><td>29.8</td><td>2,300</td><td class=\"muted\">762 · 41.7 · 6,900</td><td>10</td><td>in the wilds around 1795, 1057</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"grave-knight\" data-map-level=\"45\">Show level 45 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/5d961099bd61d57f4cf3.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/d28a65813be2b416aa1b.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/d89312091849f0a9f392.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Acid)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Ogrewax armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/d359ca17fbc7e3663f98.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/e967b61ad6358eb6e093.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Ice)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/10311a27509ce61d515c.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Shock)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Ogrewax armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/5d961099bd61d57f4cf3.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 7 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 7 looted corpses, 79 recorded drops, 5,187 total, 25–214 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 43% of 7 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">43% · 3/7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"black-walnut-crossbow\" title=\"Black Walnut Crossbow - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9eb6bfca42dff868e02b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Black Walnut Crossbow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-head\" title=\"Gold Head - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6f6e38fd2ffcc9695a20.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-sword\" title=\"Gold Sword - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/8f4629ad22105a27e233.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Sword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 1795, 1056 <span class=\"muted\">· 16 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"grave-knight\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Skeleton: <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a> <span class=\"muted\">(7)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms\">Skeleton Man-at-Arms</a> <span class=\"muted\">(36)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight\">Skeleton Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/knight-commander\">Knight-Commander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(47)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh\">Virikh</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a hre